<div class="card mb-4"><div class="card-header"><strong>Activos Property Hub ↔ recursos físicos</strong><small class="d-block text-body-secondary">Una puerta puede tener un actuador ZK y un lector QR Property; otra puede usar un relé Vimar. También se admiten bindings secundarios.</small></div><div class="card-body p-0"><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-hover align-middle mb-0"><thead><tr><th>Activo Property</th><th>Ubicación</th><th>Estado</th><th>Bindings</th><th class="text-end">Acción</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($assets as $a): $bindings=$a['bindings']??[];?><tr><td><strong><?=e($a['name'])?></strong><small class="d-block text-body-secondary"><?=e($a['logical_type'])?> · <?=e($a['code']??'')?></small></td><td><?=e($a['area']?:$a['property_name']?:'General')?></td><td><span class="badge text-bg-<?=!empty($bindings)?'success':'warning'?>"><?=!empty($bindings)?'Mapeado':'Sin mapear'?></span></td><td><?php if($bindings): foreach($bindings as $b):?><div class="small mb-1"><span class="badge text-bg-secondary"><?=e($b['binding_role'])?></span> <?=e($b['connector_name']?:'Local')?> → <?=e($b['external_name']?:$b['external_id']?:'equipo')?> <span class="text-body-secondary">(<?=e($b['execution_mode'])?>)</span><?php if(can('integrations.manage')):?><form class="d-inline" method="post" action="<?=url('asset-binding-delete')?>"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?=$b['id']?>"><button class="btn btn-link btn-sm text-danger p-0 ms-1" data-confirm="¿Desvincular este recurso físico?">×</button></form><?php endif;?></div><?php endforeach; else:?><span class="text-body-secondary">No tiene hardware asociado todavía.</span><?php endif;?></td><td class="text-end"><?php if(can('integrations.manage')):?><button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary js-bind" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#bindingModal" data-type="<?=e($a['logical_type'])?>" data-id="<?=$a['id']?>" data-name="<?=e($a['name'])?>">Vincular</button><?php endif;?></td></tr><?php endforeach;?><?php if(!$assets):?><tr><td colspan="5" class="text-center text-body-secondary py-4">Todavía no hay puertas ni cámaras lógicas definidas.</td></tr><?php endif;?></tbody></table></div></div></div>
<div class="card mb-4"><div class="card-header"><strong>Inventario físico descubierto</strong><small class="d-block text-body-secondary">Estos objetos provienen de ZKBio, ONVIF, Vimar u otros conectores. Encontrarlos no crea autoridad ni permisos por sí solo.</small></div><div class="card-body p-0"><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-sm align-middle mb-0"><thead><tr><th>Conector</th><th>Tipo</th><th>Objeto</th><th>Estado adopción</th><th>Última lectura</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($external as $x):?><tr><td><?=e($x['connector_name'])?></td><td><?=e($x['object_type'])?></td><td><strong><?=e($x['name']?:$x['external_code']?:$x['external_id'])?></strong><small class="d-block text-body-secondary"><?=e($x['external_code']?:$x['external_id'])?></small></td><td><?=e($x['adoption_status'])?></td><td><?=e($x['last_seen_at'])?></td></tr><?php endforeach;?><?php if(!$external):?><tr><td colspan="5" class="text-center text-body-secondary py-4">No hay objetos externos sincronizados en este Node todavía.</td></tr><?php endif;?></tbody></table></div></div></div>
<div class="card mb-4"><div class="card-header d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"><div><strong>Rutas de apertura por puerta</strong><small class="d-block text-body-secondary">Una misma puerta puede abrir por ZKBio API, por un relé Vimar hacia REX/Button de inBIO o por un relé en paralelo/directo a la cerradura.</small></div><?php if(can('integrations.manage')):?><button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#pathModal">Nueva ruta</button><?php endif;?></div><div class="card-body p-0"><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-hover align-middle mb-0"><thead><tr><th>Acceso</th><th>Ruta</th><th>Topología</th><th>Dependencia</th><th>Evento fabricante</th><th>Prioridad</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><?php $hasPath=false; foreach($assets as $a)if(($a['logical_type']??'')==='access_point')foreach(($a['execution_paths']??[]) as $ep): $hasPath=true;?><tr><td><strong><?=e($a['name'])?></strong></td><td><strong><?=e($ep['name'])?></strong><small class="d-block text-body-secondary"><?=e($ep['path_type'])?><?=!empty($ep['connector_name'])?' · '.e($ep['connector_name']):''?><?=!empty($ep['binding_name'])?' · '.e($ep['binding_name']):''?></small></td><td><?=e($ep['topology_target'])?></td><td><?=$ep['depends_on_controller']?'Depende de controladora':'Independiente'?></td><td><?=$ep['vendor_event_expected']?'Esperado':'No requerido'?></td><td><?=$ep['is_primary']?'<span class="badge text-bg-primary">Principal</span> ':''?><?= (int)$ep['priority'] ?></td><td class="text-end"><?php if(can('integrations.manage')):?><form method="post" action="<?=url('access-execution-path-delete')?>"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?=$ep['id']?>"><button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger" data-confirm="¿Eliminar esta ruta de apertura?">Eliminar</button></form><?php endif;?></td></tr><?php endforeach;?><?php if(!$hasPath):?><tr><td colspan="7" class="text-center text-body-secondary py-4">No hay rutas de apertura 